original is the original solution, for folders with several individual image files.
3.0 is the preferred method, using feh and ffmpeg, loads in iamges in ram, and works with multiple
xwinwrap requires xwinwrap, directly uses mpv to play a video, and is lightest on system resources, but only works with 1 monitor. Ideal for laptops or low-resource systems something, kinda glitchy.
